From: PB624 bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: build mmc_get_env_dev() only with an MMC environment

With CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI_SLOT_EXTRA set but the environment not on MMC,
CONFIG_SYS_MMC_ENV_DEV does not exist and board.c fails to build.

---
--- a/board/sunxi/board.c
+++ b/board/sunxi/board.c
@@ -540,7 +540,7 @@
 	return 0;
 }
 
-#if CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI_SLOT_EXTRA != -1
+#if CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI_SLOT_EXTRA != -1 && defined(CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_MMC)
 int mmc_get_env_dev(void)
 {
 	switch (sunxi_get_boot_device()) {
